  "system": {
    "biography": "<p>Ant-totem shaman and the adventure's villain. A former Coyote shaman turned talismonger who runs the <strong>Magic Crafts</strong> shop; he took a run from his Fixer, Solomon Daniels, and came back changed. Under the Ant totem he is crazed with power, and his psychotic fixation on the simstar Euphoria drives the plot — he means to make her his <em>Queen</em>.</p><p><strong>Totem:</strong> Ant. The book grants it no mechanical benefit; the bond is roleplay.</p><p><strong>Sleep Spell Focus (Force 2)</strong> — a real item on this sheet, shipped inactive. Turn it on for Sleep and off again afterwards, or it adds its dice to every other spell he casts.</p><p><em>Cast of Characters, Queen Euphoria p.62. Attributes, skills and gear verified from a 300 dpi render; the spell list re-checked 2026-08-03 and confirmed at eight spells.</em></p>",
